update nodes set attributes = coalesce(attributes, '{}'::jsonb) || '{"island_content_source":"legacy_mtg_guide","island_quick_facts":[{"label":"Location","value":"Shaviyani Atoll, Northern Maldives"},{"label":"Island Type","value":"Inhabited Local Island"},{"label":"Population","value":"Approximately 2,400 residents"},{"label":"Size","value":"2.0 km long, 1.1 km wide"},{"label":"Distance from Male","value":"192 km"},{"label":"Transfer Options","value":"Seaplane or domestic flight + speedboat"},{"label":"Known For","value":"Breathtaking culture, amazing beaches, excellent hospitality"},{"label":"Best For","value":"Culture enthusiasts, beach lovers, hospitality seekers, nature lovers"}],"island_overview":["Funadhoo Island is a breathtaking local island in Shaviyani Atoll that offers visitors an incredible glimpse into traditional Maldivian life in the northern region of the archipelago. This amazing island combines natural beauty with an outstanding atmosphere, providing an ideal destination for travelers seeking extraordinary cultural experiences and breathtaking tropical surroundings.","Known for its amazing beaches, breathtaking coral reefs, and excellent marine biodiversity, Funadhoo provides wonderful opportunities for snorkeling, swimming, and underwater exploration. The island''s incredible community embraces visitors with traditional Maldivian warmth and shares their outstanding way of life with breathtaking hospitality.","What makes Funadhoo special is its breathtaking natural environment and incredible northern location. Visitors can enjoy amazing beaches, explore rich marine ecosystems, and experience outstanding island culture while staying in comfortable accommodations that showcase the breathtaking Maldivian lifestyle."],"island_sections":[{"heading":"Location & Map","paragraphs":["Funadhoo Island is breathtakingly located in the northern part of Shaviyani Atoll, approximately 192 kilometers from Male. This location provides a breathtaking and incredible experience in the northern Maldives, while maintaining excellent accessibility through seaplane transfers or domestic flights.","The island''s position offers excellent protection from strong currents while providing access to amazing coral reefs and diverse marine ecosystems. Its location in the atoll makes it an ideal base for exploring the natural beauty and cultural richness of Shaviyani Atoll in its most breathtaking form."]},{"heading":"Funadhoo: Breathtaking Paradise & Marine Wonder","paragraphs":["Funadhoo Island is blessed with exceptional natural beauty, featuring amazing white sand beaches, crystal-clear turquoise waters, and one of the most breathtaking marine environments in Shaviyani Atoll. The island offers perfect conditions for beach relaxation and marine exploration in an incredible, outstanding setting."]},{"heading":"Amazing White Sand Beaches","paragraphs":["Funadhoo features breathtaking white sand beaches with gentle slopes and calm waters, perfect for swimming, sunbathing, and incredible beach activities."]},{"heading":"Breathtaking House Reef Snorkeling","paragraphs":["The island''s house reef is easily accessible from the beach and offers incredible snorkeling with diverse marine life and colorful coral formations."]},{"heading":"Incredible Island Community","paragraphs":["Experience the outstanding spirit of traditional northern island life with friendly locals and breathtaking Maldivian culture in an incredible community setting."]},{"heading":"Outstanding Hospitality Heritage","paragraphs":["Discover the island''s rich hospitality traditions and learn about traditional welcoming practices that make this community breathtaking in the northern Maldives."]},{"heading":"Beach Features","paragraphs":["Funadhoo''s coastal highlights include:"]},{"heading":"Marine Environment","paragraphs":["The waters around Funadhoo feature:"]},{"heading":"Activities & Experiences","paragraphs":["Funadhoo offers a perfect blend of marine adventures, cultural experiences, and breathtaking activities. The island''s incredible environment and outstanding atmosphere provide ideal conditions for various activities in an amazing, extraordinary setting."]},{"heading":"Breathtaking House Reef Snorkeling","paragraphs":["Explore the incredible house reef directly from the beach, featuring colorful corals, tropical fish, and excellent underwater visibility in breathtaking waters."]},{"heading":"Scuba Diving Excursions","paragraphs":["Discover nearby amazing dive sites with professional dive operators offering guided dives and certification courses in breathtaking marine environments."]},{"heading":"Island Hopping Adventures","paragraphs":["Visit nearby islands, amazing sandbanks, and discover the natural beauty of Shaviyani Atoll with incredible exploration opportunities."]},{"heading":"Traditional Fishing","paragraphs":["Experience authentic Maldivian fishing techniques with local fishermen during sunset and night fishing trips in breathtaking community settings."]},{"heading":"Outstanding Cultural Immersion","paragraphs":["Learn about local traditions, participate in community activities, and experience breathtaking Maldivian island life with incredible cultural exchanges."]},{"heading":"Sunset Cruises","paragraphs":["Enjoy amazing sunset cruises around the atoll, often combined with dolphin watching and traditional dhoni sailing in breathtaking waters."]},{"heading":"Community Life & Culture","paragraphs":["Funadhoo is home to approximately 2,400 residents who maintain traditional Maldivian ways of life while embracing sustainable tourism. The island''s community is known for their exceptional friendliness, hospitality, and breathtaking cultural traditions that create an incredible atmosphere for visitors."]},{"heading":"Island Life","paragraphs":["Daily life on Funadhoo follows traditional patterns centered around fishing, hospitality, and community activities. The island maintains a breathtaking atmosphere where visitors can experience incredible Maldivian culture and customs in their most outstanding, extraordinary setting."]},{"heading":"Local Traditions","paragraphs":["The community preserves traditional Maldivian practices including traditional music, dance, handicrafts, and hospitality techniques. Visitors can observe and often participate in cultural activities and celebrations in this breathtaking island environment."]},{"heading":"Sustainable Tourism","paragraphs":["Funadhoo has embraced sustainable tourism practices that benefit the local community while preserving the island''s natural environment and breathtaking cultural heritage for future generations to experience and enjoy."]}],"island_faqs":[{"question":"How do I get to Funadhoo Island?","answer":"Regular inter-island ferry services are also available between Shaviyani Atoll islands."},{"question":"What is the best time to visit Funadhoo?","answer":"The best time to visit Funadhoo is during the dry season from December to April when weather conditions are most favorable for beach activities and water sports. However, the island can be visited year-round with the wet season offering fewer crowds and a more breathtaking local atmosphere."},{"question":"What accommodation options are available on Funadhoo?","answer":"Funadhoo offers various accommodations including breathtaking guesthouses and beachfront properties. Most accommodations offer air conditioning, private bathrooms, and meal packages in an incredible setting."},{"question":"What makes Funadhoo''s breathtaking nature special?","answer":"Funadhoo is known for its breathtaking and incredible natural environment in the northern Maldives. The island maintains traditional Maldivian cultural practices while offering an outstanding atmosphere perfect for extraordinary exploration. Visitors can experience amazing cultural exchanges and participate in breathtaking community activities."}],"island_nearby_slugs":["foakaidhoo","feydhoo","feevah","bileffahi","noomaraa","narudhoo","milandhoo","maroshi","maaungoodhoo","lhaimagu","komandoo","kanditheemu","goidhoo"]}'::jsonb
