-- goidhoo
update nodes set attributes = coalesce(attributes, '{}'::jsonb) || '{"island_content_source":"legacy_mtg_guide","island_quick_facts":[{"label":"Location","value":"Shaviyani Atoll, Northern Maldives"},{"label":"Island Type","value":"Inhabited Local Island"},{"label":"Population","value":"Approximately 1,600 residents"},{"label":"Size","value":"1.5 km long, 0.9 km wide"},{"label":"Distance from Male","value":"200 km"},{"label":"Transfer Options","value":"Seaplane or domestic flight + speedboat"},{"label":"Known For","value":"Magnificent culture, superb beaches, excellent traditions"},{"label":"Best For","value":"Culture enthusiasts, beach lovers, tradition seekers, nature lovers"}],"island_overview":["Goidhoo Island is a magnificent local island in Shaviyani Atoll that offers visitors a wonderful glimpse into traditional Maldivian life in the northern region of the archipelago. This superb island combines natural beauty with an excellent atmosphere, providing an ideal destination for travelers seeking marvelous cultural experiences and magnificent tropical surroundings.","Known for its superb beaches, magnificent coral reefs, and excellent marine biodiversity, Goidhoo provides wonderful opportunities for snorkeling, swimming, and underwater exploration. The island''s wonderful community embraces visitors with traditional Maldivian warmth and shares their excellent way of life with magnificent hospitality.","What makes Goidhoo special is its magnificent natural environment and wonderful northern location. Visitors can enjoy superb beaches, explore rich marine ecosystems, and experience excellent island culture while staying in comfortable accommodations that showcase the magnificent Maldivian lifestyle."],"island_sections":[{"heading":"Location & Map","paragraphs":["Goidhoo Island is magnificently located in the northern part of Shaviyani Atoll, approximately 200 kilometers from Male. This location provides a magnificent and wonderful experience in the northern Maldives, while maintaining excellent accessibility through seaplane transfers or domestic flights.","The island''s position offers excellent protection from strong currents while providing access to superb coral reefs and diverse marine ecosystems. Its location in the atoll makes it an ideal base for exploring the natural beauty and cultural richness of Shaviyani Atoll in its most magnificent form."]},{"heading":"Goidhoo: Magnificent Paradise & Marine Excellence","paragraphs":["Goidhoo Island is blessed with exceptional natural beauty, featuring superb white sand beaches, crystal-clear turquoise waters, and one of the most magnificent marine environments in Shaviyani Atoll. The island offers perfect conditions for beach relaxation and marine exploration in a wonderful, excellent setting."]},{"heading":"Superb White Sand Beaches","paragraphs":["Goidhoo features magnificent white sand beaches with gentle slopes and calm waters, perfect for swimming, sunbathing, and wonderful beach activities."]},{"heading":"Magnificent House Reef Snorkeling","paragraphs":["The island''s house reef is easily accessible from the beach and offers wonderful snorkeling with diverse marine life and colorful coral formations."]},{"heading":"Wonderful Island Community","paragraphs":["Experience the excellent spirit of traditional northern island life with friendly locals and magnificent Maldivian culture in a wonderful community setting."]},{"heading":"Excellent Traditional Heritage","paragraphs":["Discover the island''s rich traditional practices and learn about cultural customs that make this community magnificent in the northern Maldives."]},{"heading":"Beach Features","paragraphs":["Goidhoo''s coastal highlights include:"]},{"heading":"Marine Environment","paragraphs":["The waters around Goidhoo feature:"]},{"heading":"Activities & Experiences","paragraphs":["Goidhoo offers a perfect blend of marine adventures, cultural experiences, and magnificent activities. The island''s wonderful environment and excellent atmosphere provide ideal conditions for various activities in a superb, marvelous setting."]},{"heading":"Magnificent House Reef Snorkeling","paragraphs":["Explore the wonderful house reef directly from the beach, featuring colorful corals, tropical fish, and excellent underwater visibility in magnificent waters."]},{"heading":"Scuba Diving Excursions","paragraphs":["Discover nearby superb dive sites with professional dive operators offering guided dives and certification courses in magnificent marine environments."]},{"heading":"Island Hopping Adventures","paragraphs":["Visit nearby islands, superb sandbanks, and discover the natural beauty of Shaviyani Atoll with wonderful exploration opportunities."]},{"heading":"Traditional Fishing","paragraphs":["Experience authentic Maldivian fishing techniques with local fishermen during sunset and night fishing trips in magnificent community settings."]},{"heading":"Excellent Cultural Immersion","paragraphs":["Learn about local traditions, participate in community activities, and experience magnificent Maldivian island life with wonderful cultural exchanges."]},{"heading":"Sunset Cruises","paragraphs":["Enjoy superb sunset cruises around the atoll, often combined with dolphin watching and traditional dhoni sailing in magnificent waters."]},{"heading":"Community Life & Culture","paragraphs":["Goidhoo is home to approximately 1,600 residents who maintain traditional Maldivian ways of life while embracing sustainable tourism. The island''s community is known for their exceptional friendliness, hospitality, and magnificent cultural traditions that create a wonderful atmosphere for visitors."]},{"heading":"Island Life","paragraphs":["Daily life on Goidhoo follows traditional patterns centered around fishing, traditions, and community activities. The island maintains a magnificent atmosphere where visitors can experience wonderful Maldivian culture and customs in their most excellent, marvelous setting."]},{"heading":"Local Traditions","paragraphs":["The community preserves traditional Maldivian practices including traditional music, dance, handicrafts, and cultural techniques. Visitors can observe and often participate in cultural activities and celebrations in this magnificent island environment."]},{"heading":"Sustainable Tourism","paragraphs":["Goidhoo has embraced sustainable tourism practices that benefit the local community while preserving the island''s natural environment and magnificent cultural heritage for future generations to experience and enjoy."]}],"island_faqs":[{"question":"How do I get to Goidhoo Island?","answer":"Regular inter-island ferry services are also available between Shaviyani Atoll islands."},{"question":"What is the best time to visit Goidhoo?","answer":"The best time to visit Goidhoo is during the dry season from December to April when weather conditions are most favorable for beach activities and water sports. However, the island can be visited year-round with the wet season offering fewer crowds and a more magnificent local atmosphere."},{"question":"What accommodation options are available on Goidhoo?","answer":"Goidhoo offers various accommodations including magnificent guesthouses and beachfront properties. Most accommodations offer air conditioning, private bathrooms, and meal packages in a wonderful setting."},{"question":"What makes Goidhoo''s magnificence special?","answer":"Goidhoo is known for its magnificent and wonderful natural environment in the northern Maldives. The island maintains traditional Maldivian cultural practices while offering an excellent atmosphere perfect for marvelous exploration. Visitors can experience superb cultural exchanges and participate in magnificent community activities."}],"island_nearby_slugs":["foakaidhoo","feydhoo","feevah","bileffahi","noomaraa","narudhoo","milandhoo","maroshi","maaungoodhoo","lhaimagu","komandoo","kanditheemu","funadhoo"]}'::jsonb
where node_type = 'location' and slug = 'goidhoo';

